    "rendered": "Affiliate Disclosure"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"611\" class=\"elementor elementor-611\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0eaeb86 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0eaeb86\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-648b116 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"648b116\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3adb02a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3adb02a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea4cb9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ea4cb9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Affiliate Relationships</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9638159 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9638159\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>From time to time, LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> , may recommend or promote products, services, or companies on <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com,\" href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com,/\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">https://lorenmichaelsharris.com,</a> in our emails, or via social media and other Content. Some of these recommendations may contain affiliate links. This means that if you click on the link and make a purchase, we may receive a commission or other compensation at no additional cost to you.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ba66d4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0ba66d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">No Extra Cost to You</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ca63a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9ca63a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"312\">Any commission we receive from affiliate links does not increase the price you pay. In many cases, you may even receive a discount or bonus by using our affiliate links.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2456016 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2456016\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Third-Party Responsibility</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-557633d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"557633d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Affiliate links may lead to products or services provided by individuals or companies not owned or controlled by LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> . We are not responsible for the quality, features, pricing, or fulfillment of any third-party products or services. Any issues should be addressed directly with the vendor.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee2f0b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ee2f0b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Compliance with U.S. Laws</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10df0d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"10df0d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This Affiliate Disclosure is intended to comply with U.S. Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines and other applicable laws that require transparency about affiliate relationships and potential compensation.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93dfb4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"93dfb4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-146fa12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"146fa12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or this Affiliate Disclosure, please contact:<br />• Email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a><br />• Alternate email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d39ffca elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d39ffca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Request a Refund (If Applicable)</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a41aa0c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a41aa0c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2100\">If you believe you are eligible for a refund or credit under the terms of your purchase:<br />• Contact us at <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a> and include your full name, purchase details, and reason for your request.<br />• We will review your request and respond within a reasonable time. Approval of any refund is at our discretion and in accordance with the applicable terms.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e709a48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"e709a48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
